    "server": "https://cloud-images.ubuntu.com/releases/",
    "type": "image"
  }
}' Create a VM on a specific cluster member ¶ To create a virtual machine on the cluster member micro2 , enter the following command: CLI API UI lxc init ubuntu:24.04 ubuntu-vm-server2 --vm --target micro2 lxc query --request POST /1.0/instances?target=micro2 --data '{
